		{
			description: [
				"It is thought that the final element would be element 173, as any bigger elements would have electrons moving over the speed of light."
				"However, Naquadah is element 174. How?"
				"Naquadah can only be found in the End. This dimension of liminal dandruff islands harbours the perfect conditions to create pockets of non-euclidean spacetime that can create apparent faster-than-light movement to an outside observer. This, along with an unknown (and possibly mystical) process of cold fusion can create Naquadah ore."
			]
			id: "35BD4AD260345CF9"
			subtitle: "Nahhh, quadah???"
